#: ../../../release/dev/ctest-output-dir.rst:2
msgid "ctest-output-dir"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release/dev/ctest-output-dir.rst:4
msgid ""
":manual:`ctest(1)` gained an :option:`--output-dir <ctest --output-dir>` "
"option, and the corresponding :variable:`CTEST_OUTPUT_DIRECTORY` variable "
"for :ref:`Dashboard Client` scripts, to specify the directory in which CTest "
"writes its output files.  Previously these were always written to the "
"``Testing`` directory under the build tree, which prevented running more "
"than one :program:`ctest` process against the same build tree."
msgstr ""
